Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.88,0:00:03.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.33,0:00:10.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bisa memanggil nama Beti,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.90,0:00:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,berarti kau tidak kehilangan ingatanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru bangun?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana yang lain?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.01,0:00:31.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula mendeteksi sesuatu\Ndan langsung bergegas pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si abang yang keren itu\Njuga pergi menyusulnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu kakak berambut perak\Ndan yang berpakaian pelayan
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,pergi menjemput adiknya yang sedang tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.15,0:00:42.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.65,0:00:46.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, mereka menjemput Rem\Nmemang tindakan yang tepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.28,0:00:47.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.68,0:00:51.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari reaksimu, apakah kau tahu sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.45,0:00:52.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Langsung ke intinya saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.35,0:00:55.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah baca bukunya Reid,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi rencana menyelidiki masa lalunya gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang sebenarnya terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang mengganggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uskup Agung sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu masuk ke Buku Orang Mati itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.25,0:01:10.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukannya masa lalu Reid,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.90,0:01:13.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku malah bertemu gadis\Nyang mengaku sebagai Rui sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.35,0:01:17.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.78,0:01:18.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya aman?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tampak buru-buru sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.03,0:01:22.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kau sudah bangun, Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin dengar soal\NBuku Orang Mati itu, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada laporan mendesak.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu ada hubungannya\Ndengan tanah yang bergetar ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.15,0:01:33.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Para binatang iblis dari Gurun Pasir Augria\Nbergerombol menyerbu menara ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.55,0:01:37.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelombang pertama yang berhasil masuk\Nsudah aku bendung.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.40,0:01:40.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, Nona Shaula yang menghadang\Ndi luar juga ada batasnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.40,0:01:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rakus sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.98,0:01:45.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi ini yang dia maksud tidak pilih-pilih?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo! Kita ubah situasinya!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.05,0:03:30.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana, Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Master lihat kehebatanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gila! Aku sampai terkesan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teruskan seperti itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meili, apa kau bisa bantu Shaula juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.63,0:03:47.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi mau seperti apa pun,\Naku tidak bisa menangani sebanyak ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.54,0:03:53.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan menggerakkan\Nbinatang iblis yang sudah kusiapkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.18,0:04:04.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serbuan binatang iblis begini pasti\Npernah terjadi di waktu sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.13,0:04:05.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.35,0:04:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini ada Meili yang sebelumnya\Ntak bisa membantu karena sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal Emilia dan Ram,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.30,0:04:16.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,rasanya mereka terlalu lama\Nhanya untuk menjemput Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.50,0:04:17.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harusnya Nona Ram sudah kembali,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.28,0:04:22.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau Nona Emilia yang mencari jalan\Ndengan menghancurkan tembok.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.41,0:04:24.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Ram aku masih percaya,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi Emilia yang secantik\Nitu tidak mungkin...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.65,0:04:29.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,menghancurkan tembok, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.21,0:04:31.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keraguanmu itu sudah menjadi buktinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, Beti juga merasakan firasat buruk.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.05,0:04:39.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula, Meili, bisa kuserahkan\Ntempat ini pada kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serahkan padaku dan pergilah duluan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang begini masih bisa aku atasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.90,0:04:48.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.60,0:04:51.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.77,0:04:54.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada masalah yang terjadi saat kau tertidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.82,0:04:56.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepatlah berdiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian jangan sama-sama memarahiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.78,0:05:03.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nih, aku sudah berdiri dan berlari.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.58,0:05:06.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kesampingkan dulu sikap aneh Barusu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sana kami bertemu Uskup Agung sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sang Rakus ada di sana?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.98,0:05:17.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada gadis berambut perak sedang melawannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.63,0:05:21.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gadis berambut perak?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.73,0:05:24.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, dia orang yang belum pernah aku lihat.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.55,0:05:27.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau siapa pun yang ikut membantu kita,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,selama lawannya sang Rakus,\Nkita tak bisa diam saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setuju.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.15,0:05:33.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tak ingin mereka pulang hidup-hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu! Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Emilia?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.53,0:05:39.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak tadi obrolan kalian\Ntidak menyebut nama Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia itu maksudnya siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.16,0:05:52.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu nama gadis berambut perak tadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius, padahal tadi kau...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sesuatu yang mungkin terjadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sendiri sudah pernah mengalaminya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.23,0:06:04.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepalaku hanya sakit sedikit.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.43,0:06:09.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram, jangan paksakan untuk mengingatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin terlalu banyak yang hilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.52,0:06:12.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak yang hilang?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.98,0:06:16.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini menunjukkan ketidaksempurnaan\NOtoritas sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.45,0:06:19.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlalu banyak ingatan\Nyang tak terbentuk dengan baik,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,sampai kepalanya kacau.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.44,0:06:22.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang menjaga mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.18,0:06:27.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang bukan waktunya kita berdebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.62,0:06:29.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi salah satu teman kita
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,sedang bertarung\Nmeski namanya telah dirampas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.00,0:06:34.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.96,0:06:36.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram, aku akan pergi duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.95,0:06:40.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan si Rakus itu tetap hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kubuat dia menyesal\Nkarena telah dilahirkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.48,0:06:46.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ice Brand Arts!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.03,0:06:52.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lumayan, lumayan juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.20,0:06:55.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata lumayan, sangat lumayan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena lumayan inilah,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.90,0:06:59.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena hebat inilah,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.45,0:07:02.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau layak untuk kami makan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uskup Agung sang Rakus!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Ada hidangan utama!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.45,0:07:12.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami sudah tak sabar ingin memakan Abang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.49,0:07:15.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kau sudah bertemu adik kami, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.60,0:07:17.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.85,0:07:20.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian mungkin tidak tahu siapa aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.09,0:07:21.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia itu musuh, orang jahat!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.09,0:07:22.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang atasi...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.85,0:07:24.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja, Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak lupa!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa pun yang terjadi,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.97,0:07:32.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak akan pernah melupakanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.53,0:07:43.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak sabaran sekali kau, Emilia.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.94,0:07:47.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau menyerang seperti itu,\Nkau bisa dianggap menakutkan, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak apa!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.43,0:07:51.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang penting adalah bagaimana\Nperasaanku pada mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.62,0:07:56.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,orang yang paling aku ingin tetap ingat\Nternyata masih mengingatku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang aku sangat bersemangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.58,0:08:06.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah kenapa kami benci orang\Nyang bertindak berdasarkan perasaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.20,0:08:09.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku juga sependapat dengannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.81,0:08:17.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ice Brand Arts.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.23,0:08:20.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu kan kemampuanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.81,0:08:25.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana rasanya kena seranganmu sendiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.57,0:08:26.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasakan! Rasakan! Rasakan! Rasakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius, jangan di situ!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.30,0:08:39.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Payah sekali kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Abang yang cuma berdiri di sana juga,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.78,0:08:45.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa kau puas hanya dengan merasa frustrasi\Nkarena tak bisa apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.43,0:08:46.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi kau bilang tidak akan lupa\Natau semacamnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.84,0:08:53.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi pada akhirnya,\Npengalamanlah yang berbicara.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan kata lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.15,0:08:59.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,kamilah yang terhebat,\Nkarena telah melahap segudang pengetahuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.43,0:09:02.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kenapa kau sok sekali?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.02,0:09:09.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin bocah tengil\Nsepertimu jadi yang terhebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.30,0:09:14.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terhebat, terkuat, terunggul, dan terbaik.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.63,0:09:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua itu adalah kata-kata\Nyang diciptakan untukku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.58,0:09:22.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid Astrea.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.25,0:09:26.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai mangsa, kau adalah hidangan terbaik.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.34,0:09:30.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membangkitkan selera kami\Nsebagai penikmat kuliner.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makan dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gigit dan cabik!\NJilat sampai habis!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nikmati sampai tuntas!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makan dengan rakus!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.93,0:09:44.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uskup Agung Sekte Penyihir, sang Rakus,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rye Batenkaitos!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.10,0:09:51.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.70,0:09:56.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyusahkan saja kau, bocah tengik!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan main-main kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.53,0:10:01.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru begini sudah teriak-teriak!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah zaman sekarang bukan cuma tengik,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.70,0:10:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,ternyata lemah juga, ya, hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.03,0:10:08.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia itu
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.05,0:10:12.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,musuh kuat yang bikin Emilia\Ndan Julius kewalahan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan hanya itu,\Ndia bahkan lebih di luar nalar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, selanjutnya kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.85,0:10:25.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eng...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.18,0:10:28.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih sudah mengalahkan anak itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kita tidak bisa berteman saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.32,0:10:32.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.20,0:10:34.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bicara sembarangan begitu, kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.95,0:10:35.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.91,0:10:38.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata kau bening banget, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.03,0:10:41.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daripada main-main di sini,\Nmending temani aku minum malam ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.58,0:10:46.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, hei, semangat sekali kau, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika aku tak bisa mengalahkanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,rencana kami bisa berantakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.08,0:10:54.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan pikir lawanmu hanya Julius!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mungkin lupa, wajah bening.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mukamu itu terlalu cantik untuk dilupakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih sudah memujiku!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus! Bagus sekali, kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.23,0:11:09.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi mulai semangat, nih.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.53,0:11:16.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keras kepala sekali kau ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.32,0:11:17.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uskup Agung!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.63,0:11:22.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi-lagi Abang selalu\Nmenikmatinya sendiri, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Curang sekali Abang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.03,0:11:27.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid, kau lihat sendiri, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada gunanya kita bertarung di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.85,0:11:33.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini wanita yang sulit\Ndiajak bicara, ya, wajah bening.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.10,0:11:35.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal saat ini aku sedang menikmatinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.88,0:11:36.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.95,0:11:38.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana yang lainnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru? Subaru?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.98,0:11:46.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.23,0:11:57.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.55,0:12:17.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah menduga kau akan muncul.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalajengking sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.68,0:12:33.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.98,0:12:35.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.86,0:12:36.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.23,0:13:02.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.58,0:13:04.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beti sampai terkejut.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.73,0:13:20.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, lega rasanya\Nkarena kau memanggil nama Beti.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau masih setengah sadar, Natsuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya bangun juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.78,0:13:27.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ruang arsip?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.29,0:13:30.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.13,0:13:32.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kembali dari kematian?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.68,0:13:40.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Titik ulangnya berbeda?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi di akhir?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa titik ulangnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa berubah?\NApa yang membuatnya begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.20,0:13:51.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.40,0:13:53.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ceritakan apa yang terjadi dalam buku itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.80,0:13:58.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ceritakan dan kita pikirkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.95,0:14:01.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah itu kekuatan kita?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berdirilah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau di dalam buku atau bukan,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tetap diberi tahu hal yang sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.21,0:14:13.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya aman?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.45,0:14:16.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tampak buru-buru sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kau sudah bangun, Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang ingin kau bicarakan, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.88,0:14:21.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, Uskup Agung Dosa Besar lagi, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.14,0:14:30.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya Natsuki dan mereka memiliki\Nhubungan yang tak terhindarkan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk sekarang,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.53,0:14:34.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,kita kesampingkan dulu meratapi\Nnasib tak terhindarkan Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.85,0:14:37.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, pertama kita harus bantu Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.63,0:14:39.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meili, bisa kuserahkan padamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar Abang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.25,0:14:44.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Payah banget langsung bergantung padaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.86,0:14:48.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi karena sudah jujur,\Njadi akan aku lakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.03,0:14:49.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berterimakasihlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja, aku berterima kasih.\NAku cinta banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.40,0:14:53.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murahan banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.68,0:15:02.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, kau membiarkan\NNona Meili pergi sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada alasannya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid akan turun ke bawah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.63,0:15:09.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin kau hentikan dia\Nagar tidak ikut campur.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di situasi yang kacau begini,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia memang suka melakukan hal\Nyang tidak kita inginkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.55,0:15:19.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki, kau dapat informasi itu juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.18,0:15:23.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, aku dengar dari si Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang menangani Reid.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.65,0:15:28.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuserahkan padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengalahkan Reid adalah syarat mutlak.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.33,0:15:34.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengerti, akan kuingat baik-baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna, Nona Beatrice,\Naku serahkan pada kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal itu harusnya diserahkan padaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.85,0:15:43.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu kita akan bergabung\Ndengan Emilia dan Ram.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.70,0:15:45.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.30,0:16:04.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak apa-apa.\NAyo kita pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.83,0:16:10.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.78,0:16:12.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu, kau sudah bangun?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada Uskup Agung sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Emilia sedang melawannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.66,0:16:19.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku tak kembali,\Nsemuanya akan terlambat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna, kuserahkan\NRem dan Patrasche padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ruang arsip adalah tempat teraman!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki, kau ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.88,0:16:29.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dan Beatrice akan menghadapi\NUskup Agung bersama Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.25,0:16:31.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ice Brand Arts!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.85,0:16:32.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.73,0:16:33.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hiyaa!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.23,0:16:40.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Emilia, aku bantu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru dan Beatrice juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.98,0:16:44.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah kalian aman.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, sekarang sedang sangat berbahaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.70,0:16:47.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mundurlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.45,0:16:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senang sekali kalian\Nsampai datang bersama-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sosok yang sebelumnya kami kagumi\Ndan yang kini kami kagumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.90,0:17:01.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi kami, kalian\Nadalah dua penyelamat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.85,0:17:03.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dikagumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.43,0:17:05.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Ram aku percaya,\Nmasa aku juga dikagumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Abang ini tidak paham, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.67,0:17:09.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.92,0:17:13.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau adalah orang yang spesial, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.98,0:17:20.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau meniru dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu dia, Abang.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.19,0:17:26.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kebencian yang seharusnya\Nditujukan pada kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bau obsesi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luapan emosi yang pekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.73,0:17:36.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau melakukan reka ulang\Nmomen mengharukan itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.93,0:17:40.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita mulai lagi dari sini, Abang.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari awal.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.45,0:17:44.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.05,0:17:45.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,dari nol...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.59,0:17:48.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mati kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan lupa ada aku juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.68,0:17:53.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Telapak Penguasa Tinju.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teleportasi Dorkell sang Pelompat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.52,0:18:05.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajah Nona Emilia adalah\Nsatu dari sedikit yang sempurna.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.95,0:18:10.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhati-hatilah, Nona Emilia.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.03,0:18:13.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menggunakan teknik yang merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.38,0:18:14.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang tadi juga terasa sangat menyengat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.88,0:18:18.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu juga termasuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.33,0:18:19.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, "teleportasi"?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.80,0:18:21.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh nama yang kelewat megah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.87,0:18:23.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal hanya trik melompat-lompat ruang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.23,0:18:27.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak ini memang hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus, bagus sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus juga, sangat bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Amat bagus, begitu bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.18,0:18:37.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saking bagusnya, dan karena bagus inilah,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami makan dengan rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.55,0:18:49.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serbuan binatang iblis masih bisa ditahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.53,0:18:53.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem dan Echidna tidak terlihat aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.80,0:18:57.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius terlihat kewalahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.03,0:18:58.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lawannya sepertinya memang Reid.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.28,0:19:02.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, apa yang kau katakan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana dan apa yang kau lihat?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.20,0:19:06.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana? Tentu saja...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.46,0:19:08.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Tunggu...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.78,0:19:11.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa tahu di mana dan\Napa yang semua orang lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.58,0:19:13.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.59,0:19:15.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepalaku cuma sedikit pusing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak salah lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa melihat semua orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.65,0:19:26.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Abang ini benar-benar curang, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.94,0:19:28.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa-bisanya mengalihkan pandangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar-benar meremehkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.80,0:19:33.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.07,0:19:38.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.73,0:19:49.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Bukankah kematian itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.18,0:19:56.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahaya banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.45,0:19:59.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hampir saja tadi aku dimakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.55,0:20:03.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadinya ingin kubiarkan hidup,\Ntapi aku tak mau menuntut lebih.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.63,0:20:06.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimanapun, terima kasih, Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang membuatmu yakin kalau dia Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau benar-benar Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Beatrice!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.88,0:20:22.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beti tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia, selaraskan gerakan kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, akan kucoba lakukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.43,0:20:36.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak mau merasakan sakit lagi,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.65,0:20:37.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,sebaiknya diam...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.47,0:20:38.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia, awas ekornya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.83,0:20:48.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.93,0:20:51.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.03,0:20:54.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berkat Ram membelokkan\Nledakannya dengan angin.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.18,0:20:58.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu benar-benar Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.55,0:21:01.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku merasa yakin sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram, ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan teriak-teriak.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia terlalu memaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu bertarung Ram itu ada batasnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.25,0:21:16.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat ini Meili masih bertarung di balkon.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.83,0:21:21.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\Nanak itu tidak diserang oleh Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.51,0:21:22.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.14,0:21:26.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak tadi kalian bicara seolah biasa saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.08,0:21:28.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu, apa yang sebenarnya kau lihat?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak tahu detailnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, entah bagaimana aku bisa samar-samar\Ntahu posisi semua orang di menara.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoritas, kurasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.68,0:21:36.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoritas?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.70,0:21:39.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu yang membuatmu tahu\Nkalau kalajengking adalah Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.90,0:21:40.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.95,0:21:42.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh iya, bicara soal Otoritas,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.35,0:21:44.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,bagaimana dengan ingatanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.35,0:21:47.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak ingat apa pun soal Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.98,0:21:52.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengalahkan sang Rakus tidak mengembalikan\Napa yang sudah dirampas.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Musuh yang merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.40,0:21:55.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.60,0:21:59.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari atas? Julius, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, mundurlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.64,0:22:05.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.14,0:22:06.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.33,0:22:08.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang lainnya juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.64,0:22:17.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata kalian paham juga\Nmenyambutku dengan para wanita.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.43,0:22:19.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian yang mau jadi lawanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.53,0:22:21.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Situasinya makin memburuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.65,0:22:27.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, ada kabar baik dan buruk.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.74,0:22:30.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, beri tahu kabar baiknya dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.70,0:22:34.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu keberadaan sang Rakus\Nyang tidak kita ketahui.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.25,0:22:35.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius? Di mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah jawaban dari kabar buruknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.25,0:22:41.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid Astrea.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.25,0:22:45.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dialah Uskup Agung sang Rakus,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roy Alphard.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.03,0:22:49.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dialah orangnya.
